<title>USA: Ameritech, Marcus set paging service.</title>
<headline>Ameritech, Marcus set paging service.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameritech Corp and Marcus Corp said Tuesday the plan to launch the first free major paging service for movie patrons.</p>
<p>Moviegoers at 36 Marcus Theatres in Wisconsin and Illinois can pick up an Ameritech pager for use while seeing a film. Customers may call families, a babysitter or colleagues and give them the pager number for use while the movie is shown.</p>
<p>Marcus Corp operates 266 movie screens in the Midwest, and operates and franchises 129 Budgetel Inns in 28 states and 31 KFC restaurants in Wisconsin.</p>
<p>- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
